---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="container">
    <h1>GDPR Compliance for AI Companies</h1>
    <p>
      If your AI processes personal data and you operate in the EU, you have direct legal exposure.
    </p>

    <h2>The Risk</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Fines up to €20M or 4% of global annual revenue</li>
      <li>Requests, audits, and enforcement actions</li>
      <li>Reputational damage and loss of trust</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The CoverData Solution</h2>
    <p>
      We help AI-driven companies become GDPR-compliant in Europe, reducing risk and accelerating deals.
    </p>

    <h2>Services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>AI Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA)</li>
      <li>GDPR audit for AI systems, platforms, and chatbots</li>
      <li>External DPO for startups and tech SMEs</li>
      <li>Website compliance (privacy, cookies, vendors)</li>
      <li>International data transfers (SCCs + safeguards)</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="cta-wrap">
      <a class="cta" href="/en/contact">Request a free AI GDPR risk check</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px 64px; }
  .cta-wrap { margin-top: 18px; }
  .cta{
    display:inline-block; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #111827; background:#111827; color:#fff; text-decoration:none;
  }
</style>

